WEBVTT

00:07.290 --> 00:10.220
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

00:10.930 --> 00:13.990
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

00:14.560 --> 00:17.460
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

00:17.900 --> 00:20.890
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

00:21.540 --> 00:24.700
Mekurumeku koshitsuki MUCHO

00:25.170 --> 00:28.200
Kodomo nya kiwadoi AMIGO

00:28.610 --> 00:31.700
Kisu shitara suikomaresou

00:32.250 --> 00:34.910
Kowai mono mitasa TONIGHT

00:36.120 --> 00:37.950
Ojikeduitara dame

00:37.950 --> 00:39.690
Oshite osarete GOING

00:39.690 --> 00:41.490
Dokkiri kibun ga iine

00:41.490 --> 00:43.490
Chakkari asa made DANCING

00:43.490 --> 00:45.090
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.090 --> 00:48.460
TROPICANA

00:50.460 --> 00:53.560
Yashi no kokage de tsukamaete

00:53.970 --> 00:57.230
Jirashite tokoton tokoton

00:57.640 --> 01:00.660
Gomen ne anata wa mou toriko

01:01.010 --> 01:04.340
Nigerarenai Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:05.110 --> 01:07.980
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

01:08.480 --> 01:11.540
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

01:12.150 --> 01:15.250
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

01:15.790 --> 01:18.950
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:22.640 --> 01:25.610
Sha-Lan-La

01:25.810 --> 01:26.700
See ya.

01:26.770 --> 01:28.310
Haré, class is over.

01:28.310 --> 01:28.980
Hey, Gupta, where's my book?
Haré, class is over.

01:28.980 --> 01:29.780
Hey, Gupta, where's my book?

01:29.780 --> 01:31.140
Hey, Gupta, where's my book?
Haré!

01:31.140 --> 01:31.470
Hey, Gupta, where's my book?

01:31.550 --> 01:32.480
Don't bother. Okay?

01:33.410 --> 01:37.650
Since Bell and Ashio came, he's been
released from his household chores...

01:37.650 --> 01:41.280
...and spends every night staying up late
playing games and watching midnight anime.

01:41.490 --> 01:43.920
He's living an unhealthy life.

01:44.160 --> 01:49.320
Yup. At this rate, in the near future, every
wrinkle in his brain will be all smoothed out.

01:50.660 --> 01:51.570
I know!

01:51.570 --> 01:53.430
You should get some more sun!

01:53.500 --> 01:55.590
I found a big flower in the mountains!

01:55.700 --> 01:56.760
Let's go together!

01:58.710 --> 01:59.470
Haré?

02:00.970 --> 02:01.910
Let's go.

02:09.580 --> 02:11.140
See, isn't it big?

02:12.450 --> 02:14.440
And the one over here is amazing, too.

02:17.660 --> 02:20.130
If you space out right there...

02:25.600 --> 02:27.590
Hey, hurry, hurry!

02:29.540 --> 02:32.900
And, and, there's a big fish here!

02:36.940 --> 02:39.280
Haré, are you tired by any chance?

02:40.150 --> 02:42.840
If you're tired, you don't have to push
yourself.

02:43.150 --> 02:46.020
Or, are you forcing yourself here for my
sake?

02:46.920 --> 02:50.090
No, I'm not forcing myself... not at all!

02:50.090 --> 02:50.750
Really?

02:50.820 --> 02:51.950
Yeah, really.

02:52.160 --> 02:54.260
Let's see... I'm excited!

02:54.260 --> 02:56.630
Exactly how big is the fish here?

02:57.330 --> 02:58.320
That big.

02:59.530 --> 03:00.600
That surprised me.

03:00.600 --> 03:01.570
Me, too.

03:01.640 --> 03:02.360
Hey, Haré.

03:03.240 --> 03:05.900
How about we bring lunches and go on a
picnic right now?

03:09.240 --> 03:12.910
When you're not up to it, gather some
courage and just say no.

03:14.950 --> 03:17.310
See, isn't this a great view?

03:18.150 --> 03:19.520
Here, this is your lunch, Haré.

03:19.850 --> 03:20.750
Thank you.

03:27.090 --> 03:28.890
Oh, that was fun.

03:28.960 --> 03:30.550
Well, I'll see you later!

03:30.960 --> 03:33.330
Yeah, see you later.

03:34.230 --> 03:35.240
Oh, my...

03:35.240 --> 03:40.170
Someone as young as you, Haré-sama,
should not be playing outside until this late.

03:40.640 --> 03:41.970
S-sorry...

03:42.810 --> 03:44.040
Dinner.

03:44.280 --> 03:45.640
Yes, right away.

03:48.110 --> 03:49.480
Um...

03:49.550 --> 03:50.170
Yes?

03:50.250 --> 03:52.510
Do you have anything lighter than this?

03:52.750 --> 03:53.910
Such as?

03:54.120 --> 03:56.380
Banana, or beans and potatoes...

03:56.460 --> 03:57.220
Bananas?

03:57.520 --> 03:58.260
Beans and potatoes!?

03:58.260 --> 03:59.160
Uh, well...

04:00.090 --> 04:01.560
I cannot let you, Haré-sama...

04:01.560 --> 04:04.430
...eat such poor man's food because you're
still a growing child!

04:04.500 --> 04:07.470
Um, that's what I've been eating all my life...

04:07.470 --> 04:09.340
As long as I, Bell, am at your side...

04:09.340 --> 04:11.870
I will never let you
face starvation, Haré-sama!

04:11.870 --> 04:14.170
I will have you eat, eat, and eat some more.

04:14.240 --> 04:17.280
But, if I eat this much, I might end up with
some health problem...

04:17.280 --> 04:18.680
Time to eat!

04:20.580 --> 04:24.070
That's why I told you, you have to say no
when you don't feel up to it.

04:24.150 --> 04:26.350
I can't say no in that atmosphere...

04:26.790 --> 04:31.780
For Pete's sake, why does everyone around
me have to have such weird personalities?

04:32.160 --> 04:37.220
Actually, if both Marie and Bell had opposite
personalities - and they were slightly calmer
than they are now...

04:37.560 --> 04:39.190
A guy's fantasy...

04:39.900 --> 04:44.930
A quiet, pretty girl that
obeys your every word. Someone that you
can take advantage of.

04:45.210 --> 04:47.970
Don't you go off and make me some stupid,
selfish man!

04:48.240 --> 04:50.440
Just between you and me...

04:50.510 --> 04:56.750
...with a wave of a Chinchikurin Stick, you
can do all sorts of things - like change
someone's personality.

04:59.120 --> 05:01.020
Castle, candy, cash heart!

05:01.090 --> 05:04.390
Let the heart melt and turn me into a
wonderful young lady!

05:07.090 --> 05:09.820
Sweet Lavé: Pheromone-emitting Lady
Version!

05:10.800 --> 05:13.820
Now, I wonder what kind of adventures are
awaiting me today?

05:14.030 --> 05:14.630
See?

05:14.700 --> 05:16.860
There's only so much you can be influenced
by this...

05:17.700 --> 05:21.270
In the first place, I'm not dissatisfied so
much with anyone that I really want them to
change personalities.

05:23.040 --> 05:25.170
For starters, we'll change Weda a bit.

05:25.310 --> 05:27.370
Tell me what you wish for.

05:28.950 --> 05:31.150
If you're forcing me to answer...

05:31.150 --> 05:34.650
Someone more bashful, who thinks more of
others, works more...

05:34.650 --> 05:37.850
...does more around the house, and is kinder
to me.

05:38.160 --> 05:40.090
So, in fact, you're full of dissatisfaction.

05:40.160 --> 05:42.250
I see no end to the complaints, so I'm going
to bed!

05:43.660 --> 05:45.060
So, that's all for today

05:45.470 --> 05:48.090
Candy Witch Sweet Lavé wants to see you
again!

05:48.170 --> 05:51.000
I'll melt your heart away!

05:54.970 --> 05:56.070
W-What is it?

05:56.980 --> 05:57.810
What's wrong?

05:57.880 --> 06:00.570
Why am I dressed up in such a skimpy
outfit!?

06:04.750 --> 06:05.720
Ojousama, what's the...

06:06.990 --> 06:07.750
Don't look at me!

06:10.490 --> 06:12.220
Please, get out of the room!

06:12.760 --> 06:16.090
O-O-Ojousama is telling me to get out!?

06:16.560 --> 06:18.700
Get out, get out, get out...

06:18.700 --> 06:19.970
I have to change right away!

06:19.970 --> 06:22.530
Oh, where are all of my clothes?

06:22.900 --> 06:24.700
Senpai, there's something strange about her.

06:25.410 --> 06:26.800
I'm sorry I'm strange!

06:27.140 --> 06:29.540
No, not you, senpai. I mean Ojousan...

06:30.010 --> 06:31.370
What's going on?

06:33.910 --> 06:35.470
Sha-lan-la.

06:36.450 --> 06:37.710
You know!!

06:37.780 --> 06:39.920
One wave of the Chinchikurin Stick...

06:39.920 --> 06:41.050
What is that?

06:41.220 --> 06:41.810
See?

06:44.360 --> 06:46.150
It looks like a brush pen.

06:46.360 --> 06:48.050
But it is a brush pen!

06:48.130 --> 06:50.220
Haré? Guu-chan?

06:55.030 --> 06:56.700
Breakfast is ready!

06:56.770 --> 06:57.740
Okay!

06:58.610 --> 07:00.230
Ashio, Bell, you can have some as well.

07:00.310 --> 07:02.140
Now everyone, eat up.

07:03.310 --> 07:08.110
O-O-Ojousama made breakfast for me!?

07:08.110 --> 07:09.820
Just for me!?!?

07:09.820 --> 07:12.080
Senpai, she's saying it's for everybody.

07:13.390 --> 07:14.750
Oh, is something wrong?

07:14.820 --> 07:17.020
No, nothing is wrong.

07:18.690 --> 07:19.830
Really?

07:19.830 --> 07:23.190
Haré, there's plenty left, so eat up.

07:25.400 --> 07:26.830
Mom...

07:26.900 --> 07:28.830
She's acting like a real mom!

07:28.970 --> 07:30.370
Of course, that's to be expected...

07:30.440 --> 07:33.270
Hey, you know, whatjust happened - is it
really because of the Chinchikurin Stick?

07:33.510 --> 07:34.200
Yup.

07:34.270 --> 07:36.210
Just one wave of this wand.

07:36.340 --> 07:38.310
Hey, that's a different one than what you just
showed me!

07:38.450 --> 07:40.570
Don't worry about the details.

07:41.180 --> 07:43.410
Then, I won't worry about it.

07:43.480 --> 07:44.750
Can you do something about that?

07:44.750 --> 07:45.250
Ojousama...
Can you do something about that?

07:45.250 --> 07:45.740
Ojousama...

07:45.820 --> 07:47.410
Ojousama made this...

07:47.490 --> 07:48.850
Ojousama made this...

07:49.260 --> 07:50.310
Piece of cake.

07:51.460 --> 07:53.690
Then and now, east and west...

07:54.390 --> 07:55.730
Well, that's a really dull special effect.

08:00.470 --> 08:02.090
Bell, what's wrong?

08:02.400 --> 08:03.390
Sleep.

08:04.670 --> 08:06.430
Wow! So abrupt.

08:06.610 --> 08:08.800
Senpai? What's wrong?

08:09.080 --> 08:09.310
East and west, south and north...

08:09.310 --> 08:10.410
Senpai?
East and west, south and north...

08:10.410 --> 08:11.810
East and west, south and north...

08:14.350 --> 08:16.010
I wonder what happened to senpai...

08:16.080 --> 08:17.010
A standard accent!?

08:17.120 --> 08:18.280
Don't you think something's wrong?

08:18.520 --> 08:19.640
You agree, don't you?

08:19.720 --> 08:20.690
You're weird!

08:21.520 --> 08:24.850
Hey, hey, let me use the stick, too.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.480
No. This is...

08:27.060 --> 08:28.080
...for Guu only.

08:28.160 --> 08:29.820
Hey, the design changed shape again!

08:29.900 --> 08:31.120
And the size too!

08:31.530 --> 08:33.900
Now, who will you change next?

08:33.970 --> 08:35.490
You know...

08:37.140 --> 08:38.230
Oh, it's Haré!

08:38.300 --> 08:39.740
Good morning!

08:39.810 --> 08:41.600
The weather is so wonderful today!

08:42.510 --> 08:43.740
Morning...

08:43.810 --> 08:45.610
And? Are you dissatisfied with Wadi?

08:45.680 --> 08:48.270
If I had to pick something, it might be his
loud voice.

08:48.350 --> 08:49.140
I see.

08:50.320 --> 08:52.380
Seafaring god, ships and ships...

08:52.450 --> 08:54.650
I know this doesn't matter, but why is the
spell different each time?

08:54.650 --> 08:57.250
Don't worry about the details.

09:06.200 --> 09:07.030
Wadi?

09:09.200 --> 09:10.690
The weather is so wonderful today...

09:11.400 --> 09:13.700
Though the sun will set at some point in
time.

09:14.640 --> 09:15.630
All right.

09:16.280 --> 09:18.370
Everyone can just disappear now...

09:18.980 --> 09:20.880
They can all disappear into nothing...

09:21.920 --> 09:25.350
Turn to nothing, nothing, nothing, nothing...

09:25.420 --> 09:26.750
Turn him back to normal!

09:26.820 --> 09:28.150
So annoying...

09:28.220 --> 09:31.880
In the first place, you have too many
complaints about other people.

09:31.960 --> 09:35.090
Then, don't go telling me that you can
change other people's personalities to begin
with!

09:35.160 --> 09:36.290
Oh, Marie.

09:37.130 --> 09:40.120
Marie, I'm really tired today, so I can't go
play...

09:41.630 --> 09:42.970
Where is she?

09:43.070 --> 09:44.200
I lied.

09:44.900 --> 09:48.640
Oh no, help me, help me!

09:48.640 --> 09:49.900
Hey, Gupta!

09:53.080 --> 09:56.110
Geez, hurry up and give me
back the book I lent you!

09:56.180 --> 09:57.150
Shut up...

09:57.220 --> 09:59.380
It's not like you need it right away.

09:59.450 --> 10:03.010
That may be true, but the way you say that,
maybe you lost it or something!?

10:03.120 --> 10:05.280
Shut up! You're being annoying!

10:05.630 --> 10:10.260
Geez... Why can't Gupta be more honest...

10:10.330 --> 10:13.160
Ravenna could be
more direct about things, too...

10:13.630 --> 10:14.460
I see, I see...

10:15.700 --> 10:17.470
Those two next, huh?

10:18.270 --> 10:20.070
Step, steps on leaves...

10:20.840 --> 10:22.640
If you lost it, say you lost it!

10:22.710 --> 10:24.540
No, It's not that I've lost it.

10:25.710 --> 10:28.980
That book is really interesting. I'm reading it
over again right now.

10:29.050 --> 10:31.350
So, can I borrow it for a little while longer?

10:33.350 --> 10:35.620
That's so unlike Gupta...

10:35.820 --> 10:37.410
Success!

10:37.490 --> 10:40.360
Oh, if that was the case, you should've said
so earlier.

10:41.960 --> 10:44.790
I was wondering why you were being wishy-
washy with your reasons.

10:44.860 --> 10:46.230
S-Sorry.

10:46.300 --> 10:48.130
It's all right. No problems.
Don't worry about it.

10:56.580 --> 10:58.640
Why did you change Ravenna as well!?

10:58.850 --> 11:02.340
Mischief and mistakes are two points you
can't take away from a magical girl.

11:02.420 --> 11:03.970
So it was on purpose...

11:04.220 --> 11:05.480
Of course not.

11:05.550 --> 11:07.710
Then look me in the eyes and say that.

11:10.020 --> 11:12.460
Oh, if it isn't Haré and Guu-sama!

11:13.030 --> 11:14.990
Hey, what are you doing there?

11:15.260 --> 11:16.250
Hunting?

11:16.330 --> 11:19.920
No, I've gotten information that there was a
suspicious animal wandering around here...

11:20.000 --> 11:21.160
Wait, your chest hair!

11:22.870 --> 11:25.840
Yeah, doesn't this convey a feeling of "now"
and "young"?

11:25.910 --> 11:27.670
From now on, unwanted hair...

11:27.770 --> 11:30.800
...goes off! Off! Off with the hair!

11:30.880 --> 11:32.380
Oh no, so out of style, and it's so gross!

11:32.380 --> 11:33.380
Get rid of it.
Oh no, so out of style, and it's so gross!

11:33.380 --> 11:35.010
Oh no, so out of style, and it's so gross!

11:35.350 --> 11:36.820
And that's how it goes.

11:36.880 --> 11:37.710
What goes?

11:38.420 --> 11:40.480
Get it off! Off! Off with it!

11:41.320 --> 11:45.590
It seems like I used the wrong spell, and it
affected people in a wide area.

11:45.790 --> 11:48.730
Mistake or not, it was a random spell you
were using!

11:48.800 --> 11:50.700
Then, it was the stick at fault?

11:50.760 --> 11:52.100
Just don't do anything anymore!

11:52.100 --> 11:53.000
Haré!

11:56.500 --> 11:58.230
Did Marie change as well?

11:58.300 --> 12:02.930
If everyone's personalities are reversed, then
in Marie's case, it means that she'll calm
down a bit...

12:06.710 --> 12:10.020
Guu, please turn Marie back to normal.

12:10.020 --> 12:12.710
I like her the way she always is.

12:12.790 --> 12:14.450
Don't be so selfish!

12:14.550 --> 12:18.820
I unwillingly played along with your
selfishness, Haré!

12:19.390 --> 12:22.230
Oh shut up! You totally enjoyed all of this
one hundred percent!

12:22.300 --> 12:24.350
Oh, that's enough! Shut up!

12:24.860 --> 12:27.390
Just because things aren't going so well,
don't go running off like that!

12:27.470 --> 12:28.200
Haré!

12:28.270 --> 12:29.360
Oh, hi Marie.

12:30.270 --> 12:32.170
...Marie is acting normal.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.600
Thanks for everything yesterday.

12:33.670 --> 12:34.640
S-Sure...

12:35.140 --> 12:37.670
I wasn't as cheerful
as usual yesterday, was I?

12:38.480 --> 12:41.910
And so you were worried about me, and
came along with me yesterday...

12:42.380 --> 12:45.370
So, I'll tag along with you today!

12:46.450 --> 12:50.390
If Marie wasn't cheerful yesterday with all of
that, and now her personality is reversed...

12:50.460 --> 12:51.990
That means...

12:51.990 --> 12:54.980
What should we do? Should we go swim
downstream? Or pick mandas? Or braid
each other's hair? I know! Let's go look at
some cute fabric over...

12:59.830 --> 13:02.460
I-I'm home...

13:02.740 --> 13:06.330
It was three days later that the boy returned
to his house.

13:06.410 --> 13:07.870
Whose voice was that?

13:13.210 --> 13:17.750
I am Weda-san, daughter of the jungle!

13:17.750 --> 13:22.780
It's normal here for everyone to be really
tanned!

13:23.220 --> 13:27.680
Second, my neighbor Rebecca...

13:45.280 --> 13:47.870
S-Something is sitting on my chest?

13:52.690 --> 13:54.780
NOOOOOOOOOOO!

13:55.620 --> 13:57.380
Eh? What is it?

13:57.520 --> 13:58.920
A ghost or something?

13:58.990 --> 14:01.260
Um, er, it was...

14:01.460 --> 14:04.090
Tell me I really want to know!

14:04.660 --> 14:06.060
Well...

14:06.500 --> 14:09.870
I was having problems sleeping, and when I
opened my eyes, on top of my chest was...

14:15.040 --> 14:16.940
Why was the elder's face?

14:17.010 --> 14:19.010
That's what I'd like to know!

14:19.010 --> 14:23.150
Or rather, why is the elder sneaking into your
room, Ravenna?

14:23.150 --> 14:24.410
It's a dream! A dream!

14:24.480 --> 14:25.210
You think so?

14:25.280 --> 14:26.220
Yeah, yeah.

14:26.290 --> 14:28.950
Then, in that case, it was a very disturbing
dream.

14:29.020 --> 14:31.220
You sure say really harsh things
sometimes...

14:33.760 --> 14:38.230
You know, I'm sure it's that thing when
people say their goodbyes to you in your
sleep...

14:38.230 --> 14:39.390
...people that have died.

14:40.870 --> 14:42.160
That can't be...

14:42.240 --> 14:44.800
What did the Elder want to tell me?

14:44.870 --> 14:46.170
He's not dead.

14:49.210 --> 14:51.480
Now, enough chatting for now.

14:52.610 --> 14:54.380
I even brought a pillow!

14:54.480 --> 14:55.570
Sure!

14:56.180 --> 14:57.410
Hey, Ravenna.

14:58.080 --> 15:00.020
Can you tell me more about that story?

15:00.520 --> 15:01.650
Actually...

15:01.720 --> 15:06.320
Last night, Mom was making a big deal that
the elder was peeking in as she was bathing.

15:07.190 --> 15:09.060
Well, I think it was just her imagination...

15:12.230 --> 15:15.170
What did you say!?

15:15.170 --> 15:16.070
Just as I thought...

15:16.140 --> 15:19.070
Damn that elder!

15:20.170 --> 15:21.940
I won't forgive him!
And so this is starting up again...

15:21.940 --> 15:22.210
I won't forgive him!

15:22.210 --> 15:23.210
I won't forgive him!
I don't like how things are turning out.

15:23.210 --> 15:24.400
I don't like how things are turning out.

15:24.480 --> 15:26.270
What is this difference in his reaction?

15:28.610 --> 15:29.670
Excuse me!

15:29.750 --> 15:31.550
W-What is it, all of you?

15:31.850 --> 15:35.550
Now, I'd like you to tell me! Where is the
elder right now!?

15:35.620 --> 15:36.120
I'll tell you, I'll tell you!

15:36.120 --> 15:38.560
I'll tell you, I'll tell you!
He's pissed off, but he still talks politely.

15:38.620 --> 15:38.960
I'll tell you, so let me go!

15:38.960 --> 15:40.480
I'll tell you, so let me go!
After all, it is the elder we're talking about.

15:40.930 --> 15:43.260
The old man hasn't come home since last
night.

15:44.100 --> 15:46.060
Things like this don't usually happen...

15:46.800 --> 15:48.270
I don't know why...

15:48.270 --> 15:52.400
...but since he told me he was going to patrol
the forest, it's been an entire day and he's
not back.

15:53.710 --> 15:57.400
Then, what showed up at Weda's place as
well as Ravenna's...

15:57.510 --> 15:59.710
...wasn't a dream or a ghost...

15:59.710 --> 16:03.940
...but the man himself?

16:06.090 --> 16:08.250
Are you all right, Ravenna?

16:08.550 --> 16:11.020
But beyond that, peeking at Weda bathing...

16:11.020 --> 16:12.750
That's the worst thing you can do as a man!

16:12.830 --> 16:15.320
But, the elder is a guy after all...

16:15.390 --> 16:17.590
He's sure to peek into a woman's bath at
some point.

16:17.660 --> 16:20.060
You know, maybe he wanted a woman to
splash water on him, saying with an angry
yet somehow happy voice...

16:20.130 --> 16:22.970
"Oh no, Elder, you pervert!"

16:23.040 --> 16:26.230
...or something like that.

16:26.540 --> 16:27.800
That's the worst.

16:27.940 --> 16:29.200
That's a crime, isn't it?

16:29.280 --> 16:32.510
That's right. There's no way we'd be able to
allow someone to do such a thing!

16:32.580 --> 16:34.480
You're not convincing at all.

16:38.220 --> 16:40.380
Elder!!

16:41.620 --> 16:43.210
No! You've got it wrong!

16:43.290 --> 16:47.850
Everyone should know that I am not the kind
of person that would do such a filthy act as
peeking into a bath!

16:48.830 --> 16:50.390
Oh, you don't believe me!

16:50.460 --> 16:51.450
How can I?

16:51.530 --> 16:52.770
Hey, Toposte...

16:52.770 --> 16:55.200
You, of all people, believe me, right?

16:55.800 --> 16:57.030
You don't!?

16:57.700 --> 17:00.300
I hope you're ready for what's coming to
you...

17:00.510 --> 17:03.280
Why won't anyone believe me!?

17:03.280 --> 17:05.330
You won't be able to cry your way out of it.

17:05.410 --> 17:07.110
Hurry up and resign yourself.

17:08.350 --> 17:09.580
Oh, it's a UFO!

17:13.650 --> 17:16.140
After him! Capture the elder!

17:16.220 --> 17:17.090
Yeah!!

17:18.360 --> 17:20.420
Wait, why are you egging them on all of a
sudden!?

17:20.630 --> 17:23.430
Oh, things are getting interesting now.

17:23.430 --> 17:25.160
Are you having fun with this?

17:25.360 --> 17:27.160
Come on, you'll lose sight of him.

17:27.230 --> 17:28.130
Oh, that's true.

17:30.240 --> 17:32.200
Wait!!

17:36.940 --> 17:38.340
Amazing!

17:38.440 --> 17:41.410
All right, what we have to do now is set a
trap.

17:41.410 --> 17:42.180
Got it!

17:54.730 --> 17:55.660
He noticed!

17:55.730 --> 17:57.030
All right, hide!

17:59.000 --> 18:01.830
The elder must be thirsty from all the running
that he's been doing.

18:01.830 --> 18:02.600
Yup, yup.

18:02.670 --> 18:06.630
So, if a piece of fruit had dropped in a very
obvious spot on the road, he won't think it
strange at all.

18:06.710 --> 18:09.040
But, there's a hole right under that fruit.

18:09.040 --> 18:11.170
When the elder falls into the hole, we
immediately...

18:11.510 --> 18:12.240
Pow!

18:17.980 --> 18:19.420
Now, take that!

18:26.960 --> 18:28.890
Ravenna, are you okay?

18:31.500 --> 18:34.830
And so, we're going to put a banana on top
of the hole.

18:34.900 --> 18:37.390
Will the old man fall for something like this?

18:37.470 --> 18:38.700
No need to worry!

18:41.170 --> 18:44.070
If you're going to use a banana, there are
other options.

18:45.140 --> 18:46.740
First, you get a pot.

18:47.380 --> 18:48.970
Then you put bananas inside the pot.

18:49.250 --> 18:51.950
Then tie it up with a rope...

18:51.950 --> 18:54.040
...and throw it into a nearby bush.

18:54.950 --> 18:55.610
And?

18:55.820 --> 18:58.290
You pull on the rope, and when you do...

19:00.460 --> 19:01.890
...you get the elder with it.

19:03.300 --> 19:05.290
You finally resigned yourself, didn't you!!

19:05.360 --> 19:06.570
That's not it...

19:06.570 --> 19:08.200
I didn't peek in at all.

19:08.200 --> 19:09.800
Then, why did you run away?

19:09.800 --> 19:11.240
T-That's...

19:12.000 --> 19:13.770
There's something between the trees!

19:16.040 --> 19:17.600
A-A cat?

19:17.680 --> 19:19.110
It was abandoned.

19:19.180 --> 19:22.480
I found it about a week ago in the jungle.

19:22.550 --> 19:26.750
I'm sure that some kids somewhere shaved
all the fur off its face as a prank.

19:26.820 --> 19:30.760
It looks like it's still a kitten, so I was secretly
taking care of it...

19:31.760 --> 19:35.920
...because neither my wife nor my son will let
me keep it as a pet!

19:36.000 --> 19:39.490
Oh, Toposte, you're a kind boy. You
understand, right?

19:39.670 --> 19:41.830
Toss away such a creepy looking thing.

19:41.900 --> 19:43.030
Just as I thought!

19:43.100 --> 19:44.900
Even if it is a cat, it can't be forgiven!

19:44.970 --> 19:46.840
And, it's rather confusing!

19:46.910 --> 19:49.600
That thing is the reason why there are
misunderstandings about you, elder!

19:49.680 --> 19:51.200
Return it to the wild!

19:51.280 --> 19:52.770
Yeah! Yeah!

19:52.880 --> 19:54.140
Guys, wait a minute.

19:54.350 --> 19:56.680
It's too harsh to abandon this little thing.

19:57.120 --> 20:01.140
It's true that it looks strange, and caused you
guys trouble...

20:01.250 --> 20:03.280
...but it's just a cat.

20:05.020 --> 20:08.690
Isn't it strange to discriminate against a cat
after all?

20:11.030 --> 20:13.130
You talk too long.

20:13.800 --> 20:16.830
I'll never let a cat like that into the house, got
it!?

20:17.140 --> 20:18.730
Oh, wait, guys...

20:22.140 --> 20:25.300
Abandon... I can't abandon you!

20:29.420 --> 20:30.850
Hey, Guu.

20:31.620 --> 20:33.850
You still have the Chinchikurin Stick, right?

20:33.920 --> 20:36.440
Can you change everyone's feelings with it?

20:37.690 --> 20:43.530
After changing your friends personalities to
fit your taste, you still aren't ashamed to ask
for that...

20:43.630 --> 20:44.890
I'm impressed.

20:44.960 --> 20:45.930
You know...

20:46.000 --> 20:48.520
I can't be of much help, but I'll put myself at
your service.

20:49.270 --> 20:53.070
Of all the ones you've used, that stick is the
shoddiest one yet...

20:57.780 --> 21:00.470
But, we can't have it die so close to the
village.

21:00.780 --> 21:02.440
If Haré says so...

21:03.180 --> 21:06.450
Why don't we have Haré take care of it?

21:07.420 --> 21:10.220
Yup. Jaguar seems to like you, too.

21:10.290 --> 21:12.590
Jaguar? What's that? It's name?

21:12.660 --> 21:13.820
But wait, why me?

21:20.570 --> 21:22.860
Give me a break!

21:24.240 --> 21:25.500
Sha-lan-la.

22:35.620 --> 22:36.520
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.520 --> 22:38.190
I wonder if snow will fall...

22:38.190 --> 22:39.850
Snow fights, making snowmen...

22:39.850 --> 22:41.790
Oh, I want to make an igloo, too.

22:41.790 --> 22:44.730
But, more than that, the bigger problem is that I can't wear all those cute
coats!

22:44.730 --> 22:46.330
Oh, just for once, I'd like to wear a frilly coat and fluffy mittens and puffy
earmuffs...

22:46.330 --> 22:49.030
Oh, just for once, I'd like to wear a
frilly coat and fluffy mittens and puffy earmuffs...

22:49.030 --> 22:56.240
And, and, cute boots, and sweaters that are
totally off the top end of the cuteness chart
and capture the heart of a fair maiden!

22:56.240 --> 22:57.600
But, that's impossible...

22:57.600 --> 22:59.110
I mean, snow in an always tropical jungle...

22:59.110 --> 23:00.470
Huh? It's snowing...

23:00.470 --> 23:00.640
Oh, thank you God!

23:00.640 --> 23:01.910
Oh, thank you God!

23:01.910 --> 23:04.640
And so, the next episode of Haré+Guu:

23:04.640 --> 23:05.310
"All White"

23:05.310 --> 23:05.570
All White
